sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Contributor
    participant Gateway as Django Auth Middleware
    participant AuthView as Login View (/auth/login/)
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant WorkspaceGuard as @workspace_member_required
    participant AppView as Workspace Resource View

    User->>AuthView: POST /auth/login/ (Contributor ID / Email + Password)
    AuthView->>DB: Query User(contributor_id or email)
    DB-->>AuthView: User Record
    
    alt Invalid Credentials
        AuthView-->>User: 400 Bad Request ("Invalid Contributor ID or Password")
    else Account Status == PENDING
        AuthView-->>User: Redirect /auth/pending-approval/
    else Account Status == SUSPENDED / REJECTED
        AuthView-->>User: 403 Forbidden / Account Status Notice
    else Account Status == APPROVED
        AuthView->>Gateway: Create Django Session (sessionid cookie)
        Gateway-->>User: 302 Redirect to Master Dashboard (/workspaces/dashboard/)
    end

    Note over User, AppView: Accessing Protected Workspace Resource (/workspaces/w/<slug>/tasks/)
    User->>WorkspaceGuard: GET /workspaces/w/<slug>/tasks/ [Cookie: sessionid]
    WorkspaceGuard->>Gateway: Validate Session & User.is_authenticated
    Gateway-->>WorkspaceGuard: Authenticated User
    
    WorkspaceGuard->>DB: Check WorkspaceMembership(workspace=slug, user=user, status=ACTIVE)
    
    alt Membership Active
        DB-->>WorkspaceGuard: WorkspaceMembership (Role: ADMIN / MANAGER / CONTRIBUTOR)
        WorkspaceGuard->>AppView: Pass request (request.workspace, request.membership)
        AppView-->>User: 200 OK (Rendered Workspace Content)
    else No Membership & Not Superuser
        WorkspaceGuard-->>User: 403 Forbidden Page (Options: Request Access via WorkspaceAccessRequest)
    end
